      "title": "Quantization-Aware Training",
      "url": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/how-quantization-aware-training-enables-low-precision-accuracy-recovery/",
      "summary": "Kimi K3 leans heavily on advanced quantization, shipping with mixed precision format (4-bit floating point for weights, 8-bit for activations. The crucial detail is (QAT). The Moonshot team ran the post-training pipeline natively in FP4. This allowed the model to adapt to low-precision numerics, preventing the accuracy loss usually associated with extreme quantization.",
